  <text x="800" y="248" text-anchor="middle" fill="#666" font-size="8">(clamps to shaft via own set screw)</text>

  <!-- Total height dimension -->
  <line x1="600" y1="135" x2="600" y2="219" stroke="#9e6a18" stroke-width="0.8"/>
  <polygon points="600,137 597,143 603,143" fill="#9e6a18"/>
  <polygon points="600,217 597,211 603,211" fill="#9e6a18"/>
  <text x="585" y="180" fill="#9e6a18" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" transform="rotate(-90 585 180)">28mm total</text>

  <!-- Info box BOTTOM -->
  <rect x="40" y="540" width="500" height="220" rx="6" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#D3D1C7" stroke-width="0.8"/>
  <text x="55" y="565" fill="#9e6a18" font-size="13" font-weight="bold">DRIVE HUB V2.4.2 SPECIFICATIONS</text>
  <text x="55" y="585" fill="#333" font-size="10">- Top-hat profile: 50mm body + 90mm flange + 18mm boss</text>
  <text x="55" y="600" fill="#333" font-size="10">- Total height: 25mm + 3mm boss = 28mm</text>
  <text x="55" y="615" fill="#333" font-size="10">- Shaft bore: D12.15mm slip fit on FEYRINX 12mm h8 (PETG safe)</text>
  <text x="55" y="630" fill="#333" font-size="10">- Split-clamp design: 2mm slot + 2x M5 clamp bolts</text>
  <text x="55" y="645" fill="#333" font-size="10">- Cassette mount: 4x M5 flathead through flange (PCD 70mm)</text>
  <text x="55" y="660" fill="#333" font-size="10">- Concentricity: 18mm boss seats in cassette counterbore</text>
  <text x="55" y="678" fill="#9e6a18" font-size="11" font-weight="bold">HARDWARE NEEDED (ALL ALREADY ORDERED):</text>
  <text x="55" y="693" fill="#333" font-size="9">- 2x M5 socket head cap screws (clamp) + 2x M5 hex nuts</text>
  <text x="55" y="706" fill="#333" font-size="9">- 4x M5 flathead screws (cassette mount)</text>
  <text x="55" y="719" fill="#333" font-size="9">- 4x M5 brass heat-set inserts (in cassette base)</text>
  <text x="55" y="732" fill="#333" font-size="9">All from your existing assortment kit B0FFSNFK3Y + B0DPQJ4W3Z</text>
  <text x="55" y="752" fill="#666" font-size="9" font-style="italic">No new hardware required. No drilling of pulley needed.</text>

  <!-- ASSEMBLY ORDER (right) -->
  <rect x="560" y="540" width="500" height="220" rx="6" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#D3D1C7" stroke-width="0.8"/>
  <text x="575" y="565" fill="#9e6a18" font-size="13" font-weight="bold">ASSEMBLY ORDER (PATH A)</text>
  <text x="575" y="585" fill="#333" font-size="10">Bottom to top on shaft:</text>
  <text x="575" y="603" fill="#333" font-size="10">1. Bottom shaft collar (Z=-2mm hard stop)</text>
  <text x="575" y="617" fill="#333" font-size="10">2. Bottom bearing housing (V2.4)</text>
  <text x="575" y="631" fill="#333" font-size="10">3. Aluminum mounting plate (6mm)</text>
  <text x="575" y="645" fill="#333" font-size="10">4. Top bearing housing (V2.4)</text>
  <text x="575" y="659" fill="#333" font-size="10">5. 60T HTD pulley (set screw to shaft)</text>
  <text x="575" y="673" fill="#9e6a18" font-size="10" font-weight="bold">6. DRIVE HUB (clamp to shaft, this part)</text>
  <text x="575" y="687" fill="#333" font-size="10">7. Cassette base (4x M5 bolts UP into hub)</text>
  <text x="575" y="701" fill="#333" font-size="10">8. Cassette stack (sinker, cam, cylinder, retainer)</text>
  <text x="575" y="715" fill="#333" font-size="10">9. Top shaft collar (light retention)</text>
  <text x="575" y="735" fill="#1f3a14" font-size="10" font-weight="bold">Print: PETG, 5 perimeters, 40-50% infill, 0.2mm layer</text>
  <text x="575" y="750" fill="#1f3a14" font-size="9">Orient flange-up (smooth top face = cassette mating surface)</text>

  <line x1="40" y1="780" x2="1060" y2="780" stroke="#1e3a5f" stroke-width="0.3"/>
</svg>'''

try:
    with open(PATH_SVG, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:
        f.write(svg_content)
    print(f"  [OK] SVG: {PATH_SVG}")
except Exception as e:
    print(f"  [FAIL] SVG: {e}")

